Minimize a von-Mises stress proxy.

Uses the mean of squared field values as a surrogate for peak stress;
avoids explicit stress-tensor decomposition when field type is unknown.

Declarative geometry specification.

Examples:
  {"kind":"primitive","name":"box","params":{...}}
  {"kind":"file","path":"model.stl"}
  {"kind":"mesh_file","path":"case.vtu"}

Improvements:
  - validation (basic)
  - stable fingerprinting for caching/manifests
  - small convenience helpers
